  "query": "-- The partition's records among the given identities, in identity order.\nSELECT\n    r.id AS \"id: AuditRecordId\",\n    r.partition,\n    r.class AS \"class: AuditClass\",\n    r.occurred_at,\n    r.draft,\n    r.recorded_at\nFROM audit.record AS r\nWHERE r.partition = $1 AND r.id = ANY ($2)\nORDER BY r.id\n",
